          "quote": "Nb-W-Si alloys—Nb-10W, Nb-10Si, Nb-10Si-5W, Nb-10W-5Si, and Nb-10W-10Si—prepared by arc melting. For the Nb-10W alloy, the microstructure was a monolithic Nb solid solution (Nbss)",
